    "A control ROM and PCM ROM are needed to emulate the MT-32. These files are normally named “MT32_CONTROL.ROM” and “MT32_PCM.ROM”.": {
      "comment": "Explanatory text shown when Boxer could not find any valid MT-32 ROMs to import.",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "K emulaci modulu MT-32 jsou zapotřebí řídicí ROM a PCM ROM. Tyto soubory se běžně nazývají “MT32_CONTROL.ROM” a “MT32_PCM.ROM”."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A control ROM and PCM ROM are needed to emulate the MT-32. These files are normally named “MT32_CONTROL.ROM” and “MT32_PCM.ROM”."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La ROM de control y la ROM PCM son necesarias para emular MT-32. Estos archivos normalmente se llaman “MT32_CONTROL.ROM” y “MT32_PCM.ROM”."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une ROM de contrôle et une ROM PCM sont nécessaires pour émuler le MT-32. Ces fichiers se nomment habituellement « MT32_CONTROL.ROM » et « MT32_PCM.ROM »."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A control ROM and PCM ROM are needed to emulate the MT-32. These files are normally named “MT32_CONTROL.ROM” and “MT32_PCM.ROM”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仿真 MT-32 需要控制 ROM 与 PCM ROM。这些文件通常命名为“MT32_CONTROL.ROM”和“MT32_PCM.ROM”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
