    "For the best experience, %1$@ needs accessibility control in OS X's %2$@ preferences.": {
      "comment": "Bold text of alert shown if the application is not yet trusted for accessibility access on 10.9 and above. %1$@ is the name of the application; %2$@ is the localized title of the Security & Privacy preferences pane.",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
